  "prefLabel": "Tra 202.19 Standard and Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 202.19 Standard and Burden of Proof.\n\n(a) A party requesting relief from the department shall bear the burden of producing evidence to show, as a matter of law, an entitlement to such relief.\n\n(b) A party asserting a fact shall bear the burden of proving the truth of the fact by a preponderance of the evidence, meaning proof that the proposition is more likely true than not true.\n\nSource. #7927-A, eff 7-26-03",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra200.html"
}
